OL,5,G0000 World's Most Dangerous Prisoners
OL,6,     FJames Robertson is one of the most
OL,7,     Ffeared men in the US prison
OL,8,     Fsystem. He murdered his cellmate
OL,9,     Fand attacked a correctional
OL,10,     Fofficer to get his wish - to be
OL,11,     Fput on death row.
OL,12,G0100 Outback Truckers
OL,13,     FRussell battles waterlogged tracks
OL,14,     Fin the desert as he tries to
OL,15,     Fdeliver his load on time.
OL,16,     FMeanwhile, Yogi's reputation is
OL,17,     Fhanging in the balance on the
OL,18,     Fbiggest week of his career.
