OL,5,G0200 Trucking Heavy
OL,6,     FDave must haul a 68-tonne
OL,7,     Ftransformer through the back roads
OL,8,     Fof Suffolk, avoiding weaker
OL,9,     Fbridges and tackling narrow
OL,10,     Fcountryside roads. Smurf faces
OL,11,     Fdelays during a time-sensitive
OL,12,     Fjob.
OL,13,G0300 Trucking Heavy
OL,14,     FMoving a top heavy five-metre tall
OL,15,     Ftram carefully through the streets
OL,16,     Fof Blackpool, and collecting a
OL,17,     Ffire engine from Deeside and
OL,18,     Fdriving it over to Cleveland in
OL,19,     FTeeside.
